  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Monitoring, Evaluation, Research and Learning for Yemen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Monitoring, Evaluation, Research and Learning for Yemen (MERLY) programme will provide monitoring, evaluation, research, and learning services to the Yemen Office Network (YON) through three workstreams (Independent Monitoring; Research, Analysis, and Evaluative Learning; Portfolio Learning &amp; Engagement). The programme will support YON to deliver, monitor, and evaluate results against the Yemen Country Business Plan and will help to ensure that YON delivers impact at scale and to a high quality.MERLY&#x2019;s outputs will inform strategic decisions about YON&#x2019;s diplomatic and development activities, as well as improve accountability and value for money (VfM). The programme will provide independent oversight, verify results, support robust risk management, and provide YON with the required evidence to push for humanitarian system reform and influence the broader international response in Yemen.</narrative>
  </description>
